# Webhooks

Webhooks automatically send information to another application when an event occurs.

### Uses:

* CI/CD automation
* Deployment triggers
* Notifications
* Third-party integrations

Example:

```text
GitHub Push → Webhook → CI/CD Server → Deployment
```

